---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, CONTACT_ADDRESS } from '../consts';
---

<Base
	title="Terms of Use — Brand in Progress"
	description="Terms of use for the Brand in Progress website."
>
	<main class="legal">
		<div class="wrap">
			<p class="kicker"><a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>
			<h1>Terms of Use</h1>
			<p class="updated">Last updated: November 2026</p>

			<h2>1. About this website</h2>
			<p>
				This website is operated by Brand in Progress, {CONTACT_ADDRESS}
				(<a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>). It presents our
				product sourcing and development services and portfolio.
			</p>

			<h2>2. Informational content</h2>
			<p>
				The content of this website is provided for general information only. Case
				studies describe past projects and do not constitute an offer, a guarantee
				of results, or professional advice. Brand names and client references are
				shown to describe work performed and remain the property of their
				respective owners.
			</p>

			<h2>3. Intellectual property</h2>
			<p>
				Unless otherwise stated, the text, design, and images on this website are
				the property of Brand in Progress or used with permission. You may not
				reproduce them without our written consent.
			</p>

			<h2>4. Contacting us</h2>
			<p>
				Messages sent through this website do not create a client relationship. Any
				engagement is governed by a separate written agreement between you and
				Brand in Progress.
			</p>

			<h2>5. Liability</h2>
			<p>
				We work to keep this website accurate and available, but it is provided
				"as is". To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any loss
				arising from the use of this website.
			</p>

			<h2>6. Governing law</h2>
			<p>
				These terms are governed by the laws of the Hong Kong Special
				Administrative Region.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Base>

<style>
	.legal {
		padding: 4rem 0 5rem;
	}
	.legal .wrap {
		max-width: 44rem;
	}
	h1 {
		font-size: 2.2rem;
		margin: 0.5rem 0 0.2rem;
	}
	.updated {
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	h2 {
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin: 1.8rem 0 0.5rem;
	}
	p {
		color: #3d3d3d;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	a {
		color: var(--ink);
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brand);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
</style>
